---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/site.config';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us" description="15+ Years of Proven SEO Expertise">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl mb-6">About {SITE.name}</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Every great story starts with a spark of inspiration—and for us, that spark was
      simple: a love for storytelling and a desire to help businesses find their voice
      online. Back in 2010, when content was just beginning to rule the digital world, we
      set out to craft words that could make an impact.</p>
      <p>Armed with passion (and a whole lot of coffee), we started as a small, scrappy
      team in Bhubaneswar, India, driven by one goal: to create content that not only ranks
      but also resonates. What started as a solo venture has since grown into a tight-knit
      team that works with clients from across the globe.</p>
      <p><strong>Susanta</strong> — Founder / Chief Blogger. With over a decade of
      experience, he's worked with businesses big and small, translating their ideas into
      content that gets noticed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
